{"@type":"Question","name":"Do heavier GSM tees cost significantly more?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Heavier fabric uses more raw material per garment, so cost rises with GSM, but the increase from 180gsm to 220gsm is usually a modest per-piece difference rather than a dramatic one — fiber content (standard cotton vs. GOTS organic vs. blends) typically has a bigger cost impact than the weight jump itself."}}
]}
