<section style="padding:4rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:#000000;">
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Why SDF Clothing</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Certified T-Shirt Manufacturer Bangladesh</h2>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1rem;">SDF Clothing has been manufacturing t-shirts for global fashion brands since 1998, running single and double jersey knits from 140 to 220gsm depending on the drape and durability a style calls for. See our <a href="/insights/fabric-types-glossary" style="color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;text-decoration:none;">fabric types glossary</a> for the difference between jersey, interlock, and piqué. As certified <a href="/clothing-manufacturers/" style="color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;text-decoration:none;">clothing manufacturers in Bangladesh</a>, we run full OEM, ODM, and <a href="/private-label-clothing-manufacturer/" style="color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;text-decoration:none;">private label</a> t-shirt production from 300 pieces MOQ per style.</p>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.9;">Available in 100% cotton, cotton/polyester blend, GOTS organic, and GRS recycled options. GSM range 120–220gsm. AQL 2.5 inspection on every bulk order before it ships.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Key Facts</p>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;">
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:0.5rem 1rem;padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #0d0d0d;font-size:0.82rem;align-items:center;"><span style="color:#e00;">✓</span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;">MOQ 300 pieces per style, up to 3 colors</span></div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:0.5rem 1rem;padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #0d0d0d;font-size:0.82rem;align-items:center;"><span style="color:#e00;">✓</span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;">30–45 day production after sample approval</span></div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:0.5rem 1rem;padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #0d0d0d;font-size:0.82rem;align-items:center;"><span style="color:#e00;">✓</span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;">In-house screen printing &amp; embroidery</span></div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:0.5rem 1rem;padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #0d0d0d;font-size:0.82rem;align-items:center;"><span style="color:#e00;">✓</span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;">FOB Chittagong / Dhaka</span></div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:0.5rem 1rem;padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #0d0d0d;font-size:0.82rem;align-items:center;"><span style="color:#e00;">✓</span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;">13 international certifications, GOTS &amp; OEKO-TEX</span></div>
          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:0.5rem 1rem;padding:0.6rem 0;font-size:0.82rem;align-items:center;"><span style="color:#e00;">✓</span><span style="color:#FFFFFF;">Free quote within 48 hours</span></div>
